# The batch files and the threat lists are STORED with Windows line endings
# (-text: git never converts them), so every route a person can take hands
# them over byte for byte with CRLF -- a clone, GitHub's Download ZIP, and the
# raw.githubusercontent.com link the self-update check prints. cmd.exe loses
# goto labels in an LF-only batch file ("The system cannot find the batch
# label specified"), and findstr's $ anchor needs the CR in the lists.
# lint.yml fails on a bare LF in any of them.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
ThreatLists/*.txt -text
